 1947	4275					; This task guarantees responsive input (no missed button presses)
 1948	4275					; Compatible with update_input_component existing function
 1949	4275					; ==================================================================
 1950	4275					; Register Contract:
 1951	4275					;   Purpose: Poll joystick + keyboard fallback and update input state buffers.
 1952	4275					;   Inputs:
