 4762	4DF2					    ; Entities with AUTO_DESTROY component have a lifetime counter
 4763	4DF2					    ; When lifetime reaches 0, entity is automatically destroyed
 4764	4DF2					    ; Useful for: projectiles, particles, temporary effects, etc.
 4765	4DF2					
