 19665	9F23					; ------------------------------------------------------------------
 19666	9F23					; EFFECT 5: SPIRAL - Pixel-row resolution via color table manipulation
 19667	9F23					; Clears pixel rows from outside in (top+bottom simultaneously).
 19668	9F23					; Works by setting color table bytes to 0x11 (black fg + black bg)
 19669	9F23					; for all 256 tile patterns at the given pixel sub-row in each bank.
